#. トラッシュルームの鍵は…
msgctxt "0001 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid "The key to the trash room..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 9>掃除当番が持って<CLT>
#. んだったよなぁ！？
msgctxt "0002 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid ""
"<CLT 9>Whoever was on cleaning duty<CLT>\n"
"must've had it, right?"
msgstr ""

#. つまり、焼却炉に近付けたのは…
msgctxt "0003 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"So the only one wh-who could\n"
"get to the in-ncinerator was..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 9>掃除当番だけ<CLT>…？
msgctxt "0004 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"...the <CLT 9>p-person in charge\n"
"of the t-trash<CLT>?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 9>焼却炉に近付かなきゃ<CLT>、
#. 証拠隠滅なんて出来やしねー…
msgctxt "0005 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid ""
"And <CLT 9>you'd have to get close\n"
"to the incinerator<CLT> in order\n"
"to destroy the evidence."
msgstr ""

#. …つー事は、犯人は掃除当番だ！
msgctxt "0006 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid ""
"Which means the only possible\n"
"suspect is whoever had\n"
"the trash room key!"
msgstr ""

#. えーっと…
#. 確か、掃除当番は…
msgctxt "0007 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"Okay, so...the person who would have\n"
"had the trash room key was..."
msgstr ""

#. え？　ボク…？
msgctxt "0008 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "Huh? Me...?"
msgstr ""

#. いやぁぁああああ！！
msgctxt "0009 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "NOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO!!!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>桑田…お前…！<CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "<CLT 26>Leon...you...!<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>掃除当番ってまさか…！<CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "<CLT 26>The one on cleaning duty? No way!<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>まさか…<CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "<CLT 26>It can't be...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>おいおい！<CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "<CLT 26>Hey, hold on!<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>あの距離じゃな…<CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "<CLT 26>At that distance...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>焼却炉を使えるのは…？<CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "<CLT 26>Could you even use the incinerator?<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>掃除当番って事はつまり…<CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "<CLT 26>So in other words...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>フン…苦し紛れの言い訳だな<CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "<CLT 26>Hmph. This is just a desperate excuse...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>山田じゃん…<CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "<CLT 26>It was Hifumi...<CLT>"
msgstr ""
